new_scene(b49, 'guild_hq', '猎人公会地下总部走廊（被攻破）', 'The wrecked corridor of an underground hunter fortress: a torn and bent half-meter-thick steel blast door hangs open at the left, a long steel corridor runs away to the right with flickering red emergency lamps along the ceiling, shattered glass, scattered papers and drifting smoke on the floor.',
          '被攻破的地下猎人堡垒走廊：左边是一扇被撕开、弯折的半米厚钢制防爆门，门敞开着，一条长长的钢制走廊向右延伸，天花板上闪烁着红色应急灯，地上满是碎玻璃、散落的文件和飘动的烟。',
          'the torn blast door, the corridor, the red lamps, the glass and the smoke')
new_scene(b49, 'delivery_room', '庄园地下无菌产房', 'A sterile underground delivery room of a mansion: a wide white hospital bed with steel rails in the middle with its pillow end at the left, a wall of monitors and life-support machines behind the head of the bed at the left, instrument trolleys and a round surgical lamp center-right, a heavy steel door in the right wall, white tiles and cold light.',
          '庄园地下无菌产房：中间是一张带钢护栏的宽大白色病床，枕头那一端在左边，床头后面左边是一整面监护仪和生命维持设备，中右是器械推车和一盏圆形无影灯，右墙上是一扇厚重的钢门，白色瓷砖和冷白的灯光。',
          'the bed, the monitor wall, the trolleys, the surgical lamp and the steel door')
new_scene(b49, 'tower_office', '摩天楼顶层的角落办公室（黄昏）', 'A corner office on the top floor of a glass skyscraper at dusk: a floor-to-ceiling glass wall showing a city skyline in warm dusk light fills the back, a long dark desk at the left.',
          '黄昏时分摩天楼顶层的角落办公室：后面是整面落地玻璃墙，墙外是暖色黄昏中的城市天际线，左边是一张长长的深色办公桌。',
          'the glass wall, the skyline and the desk')
new_scene(b49, 'castle_court', '古老石头城堡的庭院（雾）', 'The cobbled courtyard of an old stone castle in drifting grey mist: an old stone wall with a pointed archway at the left, a dry stone fountain in the middle of the courtyard.',
          '飘着灰色薄雾的古老石头城堡庭院，地面是鹅卵石：左边是古老的石墙和一个尖拱门，庭院中间是一座干涸的石头喷泉。',
          'the wall, the archway and the dry fountain')
new_scene(b49, 'ice_field', '西伯利亚冰原', 'A vast flat siberian ice field under pale blue arctic light with snow flurries drifting, a small dark wooden hut very far away at the left, the horizon at the right.',
          '西伯利亚辽阔平坦的冰原，淡蓝色的极地光线，雪花飘动，左边极远处有一间小小的深色木屋，右边是地平线。',
          'the ice field, the hut and the horizon')
new_scene(b49, 'garden_lawn', '庄园阳光草坪（茶话会）', 'The sunlit manicured lawn of a luxurious mansion: long white-clothed tea tables at the left, a stone fountain with a wide round basin at the right, a tall rose hedge and the sunlit mansion terrace in the background, bright warm afternoon light.',
          '豪华庄园阳光明媚、修剪整齐的草坪：左边是铺着白桌布的长条茶桌，右边是带宽大圆形水池的石头喷泉，后面是高高的玫瑰篱笆和洒满阳光的庄园露台，明亮温暖的午后光线。',
          'the tea tables, the fountain, the rose hedge and the terrace')

