    "<killian_robe_gold> presses his clawed hand hard against his chest; a blinding golden light wells up between his fingers and a single glowing golden drop gathers at the tip of one claw, trembling; his face drains pale, his jaw clenched and his brows crashing together, a vein standing out at his temple.",
